---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const CF = '-sPAUAWeA405NiWJ0SNIQA';
const heroImg   = `https://imagedelivery.net/${CF}/5a039890-c1aa-49c4-f98e-46aad2763e00/public`;
const secondImg = `https://imagedelivery.net/${CF}/acee44b7-0888-4105-ae50-f87f130fbd00/public`;
---
<BaseLayout>
  <!-- Scanline overlay -->
  <div aria-hidden="true" style="pointer-events:none;position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:999;background:repeating-linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(0,0,0,0.12) 0px,rgba(0,0,0,0.12) 1px,transparent 1px,transparent 2px);"></div>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section style="min-height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:center;text-align:center;padding:2rem;position:relative;overflow:hidden;">

    <!-- Cloudflare Images CDN — Hero background -->
    <div
      aria-hidden="true"
      style={`position:absolute;inset:0;background:url('${heroImg}') center/cover no-repeat,#000;opacity:0.38;`}
    ></div>

    <div style="position:relative;z-index:1;max-width:860px;">
      <p style="letter-spacing:0.4em;font-size:0.75rem;color:#00ff41;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:1.2rem;">CLASSIFIED // NV-51 // EYES ONLY</p>

      <h1 style="font-size:clamp(2.4rem,7vw,5.5rem);font-weight:900;line-height:1.05;color:#fff;letter-spacing:-0.02em;text-transform:uppercase;">
        AREA<span style="color:#00ff41;">51</span>.MONSTER
      </h1>

      <p style="margin:1.5rem auto 0;font-size:clamp(1rem,2.5vw,1.35rem);max-width:640px;line-height:1.7;color:#b0b0b0;">
        Deep beneath the Nevada desert, miles of excavated earth have carved out the most classified real estate on the planet — alien spacecraft hangars, subterranean tunnels stretching toward the Pacific coast, and a story the world has never been allowed to read.
      </p>

      <p style="margin:1.2rem auto 0;font-size:clamp(0.9rem,2vw,1.1rem);max-width:580px;line-height:1.7;color:#6a6a6a;font-style:italic;">
        So much earth has been removed from this site that what remains below defies conventional explanation. Spaceship storage. Tunnel networks. Ocean access.
      </p>

      <!-- Primary CTA -->
      <div style="margin-top:2.5rem;">
        <a
          href="mailto:sales@desertrich.com?subject=area51.monster%20Acquisition%20Inquiry&body=I'm%20interested%20in%20acquiring%20area51.monster%20and/or%20the%20associated%20story%20concept."
          style="display:inline-block;padding:1rem 2.6rem;background:#00ff41;color:#000;font-family:'Courier New',monospace;font-weight:900;font-size:1.05rem;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;cursor:pointer;transition:background 0.2s;"
        >
          ACQUIRE THIS DOMAIN
        </a>
        <p style="margin-top:0.75rem;font-size:0.72rem;color:#3a3a3a;letter-spacing:0.15em;">sales@desertrich.com // CLEARED INQUIRIES ONLY</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Story Section -->
  <section style="max-width:800px;margin:0 auto;padding:5rem 2rem;">
    <h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.4rem,3.5vw,2.2rem);color:#fff;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.08em;margin-bottom:1.8rem;border-left:3px solid #00ff41;padding-left:1rem;">
      The Excavation Story
    </h2>
    <p style="line-height:1.9;margin-bottom:1.4rem;">
      The sheer volume of earth displaced at and around the Area 51 complex in the Nevada desert is a geological anomaly that has never been fully accounted for. Official narratives describe test aircraft and radar experimentation. They do not account for cubic miles of removed desert floor.
    </p>
    <p style="line-height:1.9;margin-bottom:1.4rem;">
      What if the excavations served a different purpose entirely? An underground storage complex of unprecedented scale — designed not for human aircraft, but for vehicles that did not originate on this planet. Hangars carved from bedrock. Climate-controlled vaults. A network of pressurized tunnels following the geography westward, terminating somewhere along the Pacific.
    </p>

    <!-- Cloudflare Images CDN — Secondary image -->
    <div style="margin:2.5rem 0;position:relative;overflow:hidden;">
      <img
        src={secondImg}
        alt="Subterranean Nevada desert excavation — classified infrastructure"
        width="800"
        height="450"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
        style="width:100%;height:auto;display:block;opacity:0.82;border:1px solid #1a1a1a;"
      />
      <p style="margin-top:0.5rem;font-size:0.65rem;color:#2a2a2a;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;">CLASSIFIED IMAGERY // NV-51 SECTOR</p>
    </div>

    <p style="line-height:1.9;margin-bottom:1.4rem;">
      The tunnel-to-ocean hypothesis is not new. What is new is the narrative architecture built around it — a script concept, a world, a mythology ready for film or series development.
    </p>

    <h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.4rem,3.5vw,2.2rem);color:#fff;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.08em;margin:3rem 0 1.8rem;border-left:3px solid #00ff41;padding-left:1rem;">
      For Acquisition
    </h2>
    <p style="line-height:1.9;margin-bottom:1.4rem;">
      <strong style="color:#fff;">area51.monster</strong> is available for domain acquisition, story concept licensing, movie script sale, or film/series development partnership. The domain name, the narrative IP, and the conceptual framework are offered as a single package or individually.
    </p>
    <ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;margin-bottom:2rem;">
      <li style="padding:0.6rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid #1a1a1a;color:#b0b0b0;">⬡ &nbsp;Domain acquisition — <strong style="color:#fff;">area51.monster</strong></li>
      <li style="padding:0.6rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid #1a1a1a;color:#b0b0b0;">⬡ &nbsp;Movie script — Nevada underground / tunnel system concept</li>
      <li style="padding:0.6rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid #1a1a1a;color:#b0b0b0;">⬡ &nbsp;Series development deal — classified mythology universe</li>
      <li style="padding:0.6rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid #1a1a1a;color:#b0b0b0;">⬡ &nbsp;IP licensing — alien storage / desert mythology</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <!-- Obscure acquisition trigger -->
  <section style="padding:2rem;text-align:center;">
    <p style="font-size:0.65rem;color:#1c1c1c;letter-spacing:0.3em;text-transform:uppercase;">SIGNAL ACQUISITION PROTOCOL</p>
    <a
      href="mailto:sales@desertrich.com?subject=%5BSIGNAL%5D%20area51.monster%20Acquisition&body=Initiating%20acquisition%20protocol."
      style="display:inline-block;margin-top:0.5rem;width:12px;height:12px;background:#00ff41;border-radius:50%;opacity:0.18;transition:opacity 0.3s;"
      aria-label="Acquisition signal"
      onmouseover="this.style.opacity='1'"
      onmouseout="this.style.opacity='0.18'"
    ></a>
  </section>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <footer style="border-top:1px solid #111;padding:2rem;text-align:center;font-size:0.7rem;color:#2a2a2a;letter-spacing:0.2em;">
    <p>area51.monster &mdash; CLASSIFIED // ALL RIGHTS RESERVED // DESERTRICH.COM</p>
    <p style="margin-top:0.4rem;"><a href="mailto:sales@desertrich.com" style="color:#2a2a2a;">sales@desertrich.com</a></p>
  </footer>
</BaseLayout>
